				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lacynth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(299024); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=299024&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607850063" alt="Lacynth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=299024)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lacynth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(299024); return false;" >Lacynth</a></span> <span class="odate time_1237185633 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">16 Mar 2009 06:40</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-417610">
									

<p>Provided no severe mental illnesses come forth on test subjects, I believe SCP-034 should be temporarily issued to Mobile Task Force Omega-7, and members issued bits of "Abel" (SCP-076-2) cut off with this SCP item. An entire team of "Abel's" when direly needed would reduce the amount of casualties "Pandora's Box" suffers on high-risk operations. I doubt Abel would mind too much, as he doesn't seem to register pain as horribly as normal Agents do.</p>

							</div>

								
					
