			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-417616">
									

<p>Except they would not be imitations, they would be copies. And as long as Abel realizes that it is temporary, lasting only an hour, I doubt he would destroy his own team. In fact, I believe he would enjoy the only true challenge he would ever have, himself.</p>
<p>How about this, SCP-682 used as the copy subject? The abilities of SCP-682, including the regenerative and adaptive abilities, with a mind for the mission. The only trouble is if SCP-682 adapts the SCP-034 ability to create copies of itself by ripping chunks of itself off. Still, it is something to think about.</p>

